  <a href="t.me/CalsiBotDev/23">/restrict</a>, <a href="t.me/CalsiBotDev/82">/warn</a>, <a href="t.me/CalsiBotDev/48">/JoinLock</a>, и <a href="t.me/CalsiBotDev/74">/JoinLimit</a>

